	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Rediit vir quidam bonus<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Unbekannt.</note> ex comitiis <placeName ref="l199">Haganoensibus</placeName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zum Religionsgespräch in <placeName ref="l199">Hagenau</placeName> s. oben <ref target="file11442">Nr. 1399</ref>, Anm. 9.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is primo <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>dixit sic <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName> urgeri ad nos excindendos, ut veritus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>fuerit aliquamdiu bellum<pb type="edition" next="134"/> inceptum, priusquam redire posset domum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Deinde legatos nostros (quos domini miserunt ob suas causas<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p5832">Bernhard Meyer</persName> und Stadtschreiber <persName ref="p2804">Ryhiner</persName> waren beauftragt, mit König <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand</persName> über das habsburgische Lehen <placeName ref="l1786">Hüningen</placeName> zu verhandeln (s. <bibl source="b62">ADRG</bibl> 1/2 832-834. 838f; <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> SA. Missiven B 3, 15r. <hi>-v.</hi> 39v.-40r.; Finanz G 16, 359). Dem Religionsgespräch blieb <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> fern (vgl. <bibl source="b62">ADRG</bibl> I/1 948f; <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> III 59).</note>), <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quia non se adiunxerint diebus aliquot legatis civitatum, sermonem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>inter pfaffos excitasse, quod dissensio sit inter ipsos, unde mirum, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quam sint gavisi et pertinaciores effecti in suo proposito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Venit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>is rumor ad nostros; hi protinus inter coenandum obruerunt <placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p4082">Konrad Zwick</persName>, <persName ref="p5741">Joachim Maler</persName> und <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName>; s. <bibl source="b51">Blarer BW</bibl> II 52, Anm.1.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>et qui cum eis erant, et apud eos coenati sunt tanto <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>gaudio, ut iucundum sit audire.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Postero die nostri invitarunt <lb xml:id="p1z11"/><placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> et reliquos, ut decem et novem legati convenerint.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Tunc <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vero gaudium pfafforum non parum imminutum est.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Interea venerun<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>t legati a <placeName ref="l749">Saxone</placeName> et <placeName ref="l213">Hesso</placeName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Abgeordnete des Kurfürsten <persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich von Sachsen</persName> waren <persName ref="p7810">Christoph von Taubenheim</persName>, <persName ref="p7454">Hans von Dolzig</persName>, <persName ref="p4460">Franz Burchart</persName> und <persName ref="p7195">Lorenz Zoch</persName>, während Landgraf <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> die Räte <persName ref="p17778">Alexander von der Tann</persName>, <persName ref="p18321">Rudolf Schenk zu Schweinsberg</persName>, <persName ref="p18105">Johann Fischer (gen. Walther)</persName> und <persName ref="p5972">Georg Nußpicker</persName> entsandte; s. <bibl source="b62">ADRG</bibl> I/1 356 u. ö.</note>, et apud nostros omnes gaudium exortum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>est, verum parum bonę spei; tam fortes sunt et tam multi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>episcopi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Fuerunt hic pridie, quam hęc scriberem, viri quidam docti, e quibus <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>unus<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Zu denken ist an <persName ref="p5844">Jakob Micyllus</persName>, für den <persName ref="p164">Amerbach</persName> als Rektor der Universität am 2. Juli ein Gastmahl gab; s. <persName ref="p164">Amerbach</persName>, Korr. V 294.</note> dixit in aurem mihi <persName ref="p4503">Camerarium</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p4503">Joachim Camerarius</persName>.</note> <placeName ref="l512">Tubingensem</placeName> narrasse, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>dum <persName ref="p20278">Faber</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p20278">Johannes Fabri</persName>, Bischof von <placeName ref="l546">Wien</placeName>.</note> ad comitia venerit, venisse cum bono quodam <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>viro in colloquium.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Hunc inter alia dixisse: „Mirabilis erit disputatio; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nam sunt viri certe ab evangelio stantes docti et adpri<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>me armati scripturis, ut non sint facile cessuri.“</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Tum <persName ref="p20278">Fabrum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>respondisse: „Es darff<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="9">bedarf.</note> nit vil disputierens; es muͦß mit einr <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>kalten klingen usgericht werden.“<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11430">Nr. 1387</ref>, Anm. 2.</note></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Hęc deinceps sunt mihi confirmata, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ut non possit esse dubium episcopos nihil nisi bellum moliri.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Dum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>igitur ad superiora respicio, non possum non revocare in memoriam, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quod postremo vobis scripsi<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Siehe oben <ref target="file11443">Nr. 1400</ref>. - Zweifellos war <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> enttäuscht darüber, daß <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> die Entsendung <placeName ref="l862">eidgenössischer</placeName> Theologen nach <placeName ref="l199">Hagenau</placeName> entschieden abgelehnt hatte (vgl. das Schreiben <placeName ref="l587">Zürichs</placeName> an <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> vom 31. Mai, <bibl source="b62">ADRG</bibl> I/2 829-832).</note> simul famam tantum de vestro, id est <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiorum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>adventu perterrefacere potuisse adversarios; non habent enim, quod <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>eos reddat pertinaciores quam dissidium nostrum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Et dum hoc tempore non<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nihil de nostro omnium concordia foret dictum, ut aliquid spei in speciem reliquum<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">in speciem reliquum <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> haberent, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>dixit <persName ref="p20278">Faber</persName>: „O concordiam; ficta est, nihil igitur timemus.“</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ex quibu<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>s certum est, quod dixi, dissidium nostrum illos reddere fortes.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Velim, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ut consultatio<pb type="edition" next="135"/> fieret et de concordia et de obviando malis, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quę imminent.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Equidem pro christianis vix habeo, qui in consult<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ando non sunt hic diligentissimi et providentissimi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Possem multa ad<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>huc adiicere, si non certiora expectarem.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18593">Turca</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Sultan <persName ref="p18593">Suleiman I.</persName></note> certissime dam<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>num grave intulit et bellum instauravit<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Ein unzutreffendes Gerücht.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Equidem insanio, dum cogito doctorum in dissidendo, non dico stulticiam, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>non amentiam, sed ipsissimam impietatem.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Dominus det spem concordię.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, raptim, 4. iulii anno 40.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">D<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>omino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName> suo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>in domino.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Z[ü]rich</placeName><note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Teilweise auf das nicht mehr vorhandene Verschlußband geschrieben.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
